title: Fix stale bandersnatch static public keys in sp-keyring
doc:
  - audience: Runtime Dev
    description: |
      `ark-vrf` 0.5.3 implements draft-35 of the Bandersnatch VRF specification
      (https://github.com/davxy/bandersnatch-vrf-spec). Between draft-29 and
      draft-35 the specification changed how the secret scalar is derived from
      a seed, so the key pair obtained from a given seed changed. The static
      public keys in `sp-keyring` were still the ones derived under draft-29
      (`ark-vrf` 0.2.2) and no longer matched the keys that `sp-core` derives
      from the same seeds. This refreshes them to the draft-35 values. Only
      relevant with the `bandersnatch-experimental` feature.
crates:
  - name: sp-keyring
    bump: patch
